irects travellers to the conductor.","focus":"detail"},{"id":"q5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Which time has not changed?","options":["The train at 2:06","The train at 2:46","The Winton bus at 2:06","The Winton bus at 2:46"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Only the train runs five minutes late.","focus":"detail"}]}$seed$::jsonb) r
