    from jsonb_populate_record(null::public.speaking_prompts, $seed${"slug":"a2-reorder-a-morning-routine","title":"Explain a Change in Your Morning Routine","level":"A2","status":"published","sort_order":371,"metadata":{"task_type":"explain","cue_keywords":[["used to","after breakfast","used the table"],["night before","bag by the door","get the bag ready"],["easier","eat together","space at the table","no longer","can leave"]],"model_answer":"I used to put my books in my bag after breakfast. Everything was on the table, and my brother needed the same space to eat. Now I get my bag ready the night before and leave it by the door. In the morning we can eat together because the table is clear. It is easier to leave on time, too. I can pick up the bag and go.","model_opening":"I used to put my books in my bag after breakfast."},"prompt_text":"You used to get your bag ready after breakfast. Now two people need to use the same table in the morning, so you put your things together the night before. Explain what you did before, what you changed, and one thing that is easier now.","prompt_type":"guided_response","target_duration_seconds":45,"target_grammar":"Used to for the old habit and present simple for the new one. Use because for a reason.","target_vocabulary":["breakfast","get ready","table","the night before","leave"],"fluency_objective":"Place a clear pause between the old and new routine. Then say the benefit in one or two sentences.","pronunciation_objective":"Stress morning and night before to signal what changed.","cue_points":["Say what you used to do.","Describe the new routine.","Give one reason or benefit."]}$seed$::jsonb) r
