    from jsonb_populate_record(null::public.learning_content_registry_items, $seed${"service_key":"grammar","content_type":"grammar.unit","source_table":"grammar_units","source_ref":"c2-qualifying-claims-with-insofar-as","title":"Qualifying claims with insofar as","skill_key":"grammar","cefr_level":"C2","difficulty":0.9,"status":"published","description":"Use insofar as or to the extent that to specify how far a claim holds. In a review, the qualifying clause can identify the part of the evidence that supports a conclusion. If a review examined weekday services alone, its conclusion about reliability applies insofar as it concerns weekday services. That wording leaves weekend reliability open.\n\nUse provided that or on condition that to state a requirement that must be met for a permission or arrangement to take effect. If researchers may access records provided that they sign a confidentiality agreement, signing is the condition for access. A scope clause can instead specify which parts of the records a permission covers.\n\nUse except where to carve out an exception from a general rule. If a licence permits reuse except where a third party holds copyright, reuse is the default and those cases are excluded. When editing, ask whether the cla","subskill_keys":["grammar.accuracy","grammar.scope-limiters-in-claims","grammar.transfer"],"estimated_minutes":8,"learning_objective":"Insofar as and to the extent that define the reach of a claim or permission. Provided that and on condition that set a prerequisite. Except where introduces cases excluded from a general statement or rule.","tags":["c2","scope-qualification","insofar-as","conditional-permission","exceptions"],"payload_json":{"focus_area":"scope-limiters-in-claims","common_error_pattern":"Using provided that for an established limit on what a review supports can make the conclusion sound contingent. Using insofar as for an approval requirement can make permission sound divisible when the rule grants or withholds it as a whole.","examples":[{"bad":"[The review assessed delivery times alone.] The review's favourable conclusion is warranted provided that it concerns delivery times.","good":"[The review assessed delivery times alone.] The review's favourable conclusion is warranted insofar as it concerns delivery times."},{"bad":"The comparison is valid to the extent the that both surveys used the same sampling method.","good":"The comparison is valid to the extent that both surveys used the same sampling method."},{"bad":"[Written consent is a prerequisite for releasing the recording.] The archive may release the recording insofar as the speaker gives written consent.","good":"[Written consent is a prerequisite for releasing the recording.] The archive may release the recording on condition that the speaker gives written consent."},{"bad":"[Public access is the default and sealed files are excluded.] The files are open to the public provided that a court has sealed them.","good":"[Public access is the default and sealed files are excluded.] The files are open to the public except where a court has sealed them."}]}}$seed$::jsonb) r
